{"id":"63d809770775f636","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-reflection-hierarchy.md","title":"Pi-One Consequences of Local Reflection","display":"thm-reflection-hierarchy — Pi-One Consequences of Local Reflection","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-reflection-hierarchy","aliases":["67-thm-reflection-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-reflection-hierarchy — Pi-One Consequences of Local Reflection","depends_on":["[[67-df-local-reflection]]","[[67-df-iterated-consistency]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-certified-proof]]","[[67-df-proof-representation]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":4,"source_label":"Theorem 5; Lemmas 3–4","source_printed_pages":"55–57","source_pdf_pages":"66–68","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"Theorem 4.5 及反向 Lemma 3(a) 已定位并核对陈述；内部递归证明归约未完整独立核验","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-reflection-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-reflection-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-hierarchy — Pi-One Consequences of Local Reflection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 5; Lemmas 3–4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"55–57"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"66–68"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"Theorem 4.5 及反向 Lemma 3(a) 已定位并核对陈述；内部递归证明归约未完整独立核验"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理呈示，使用本册固定证明算术化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 量化原书层级的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句子；不加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠性假设。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一致性迭代与局部反思共同使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a> 的种子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_T\">\\(\\sigma_T\\)</span>，并绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_T}\\)</span>；不得在同一比较中改变证明公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\Bigl(T\\cup\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\vdash\\pi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\\vdash\\pi\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\Bigl(T\\cup\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\vdash\\pi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\\vdash\\pi\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧稿只有复杂度类嵌套所给的反思实例集合包含；现恢复原书 Theorem 4.5 的非平凡后果比较。源定理明确写局部反思扩张的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果可由 PA 加有限一致性迭代证明；反向来自 Lemma 3(a) 逐次推出这些迭代，所以这里记录等价。</p>\n<p>来源陈述与有限反思片段归约到足够高一致性迭代的证明结构已读；未逐行复核其内部证明编码的递归归约。这里的等价只针对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠背景下两理论整体仍可严格不同（Theorem 4(a)）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"bfe810351301dc7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-local-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f9e2ecde3df48a